Description: This package processes AMR data matrices from `amR_data`
     (genomic features by genomes w/ paired AMR phenotypic labels), makes them
     ML-ready, and trains ML models (LR). Model outputs (e.g., performances,
     top features) can be summarized and visualized across drugs, drug classes,
     and passed along to `amR_shiny` to spin up a dashboard to explore these results.
